  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
